        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="/events/2013-11-06-cdn-solid-principles/"/>
        <id>/events/2013-11-06-cdn-solid-principles/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="/events/2013-11-06-cdn-solid-principles/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-1-cdns-can-be-free-cheap-or-expensive&quot;&gt;Talk 1: CDNs can be free, cheap or expensive&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Content delivery networks used to be technically advanced but expensive solutions used by big corporations only. Nowadays there&#x27;s players with cheap offers (like Amazon CloudFront) and even free offers (like Google&#x27;s unlimited free beta of the Pagespeed CDN). This talk includes a live demo of how CloudFront and Pagespeed CDN are configured and a discussion of their respective pros and cons. Participants may want to apply for a free &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;developers.google.com&#x2F;speed&#x2F;pagespeed&#x2F;service&quot;&gt;Pagespeed CDN&lt;&#x2F;a&gt; invitation in advance, b.c. it takes a couple of days to be invited.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;a href=&quot;http:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.php-schulung.de&#x2F;&quot;&gt;Timon Schroeter&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;talk-2-don-t-be-stupid-grasp-solid&quot;&gt;Talk 2: Don&#x27;t Be Stupid, Grasp Solid&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;twitter.com&#x2F;ircmaxell&quot;&gt;Anthony Ferrara&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
</content>
        
